<title>USA: Festus, Mo., won by Dean Witter.</title>
<headline>Festus, Mo., won by Dean Witter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dean Witter Ryenolds Inc., said it won $3.525 million of Festus, Mo., combined waterworks and sewerage system refunding revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.2707 percent.</p>
</text>
